{"id":"msg_m_ex_mana_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_mana","label":"Mana · Nikke"},"label":"3. Hello Commander.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_mana_02","next":null,"speakers":{"mana":"Mana"},"icons":{"mana":"si_c290_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_1","text":"Hello Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_2","text":"Do you have a moment?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_3","text":"Sure. What's up?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_4","text":"I just wanted to say...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_5","text":"That I'm really sorry about before.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_6","text":"What do you mean?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_7","text":"I made a fool of myself last time when I drank,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_8","text":"and I put you","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_9","text":"in an awkward position.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_10","text":"I'm really sorry.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_11","text":"It's okay. These things happen.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_12","text":"They shouldn't.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_13","text":"A proper employee would","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_14","text":"never allow something like that to happen.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_15","text":"Not only am I a researcher, but I'm also a Nikke,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_16","text":"and so the last thing I should be doing is making your life difficult.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_17","text":"Like when I...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_18","text":"Anyway, once again,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_19","text":"I sincerely apologize, Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_20","text":"I really don't mind.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_21","text":"Thank you","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_22","text":"for saying that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_23","text":"By the way, were you really feeling okay that day?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_24","text":"Not at all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_25","text":"How could I, after drinking as much as I did?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_26","text":"Ha, I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_27","text":"I'm fine now, though.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_28","text":"Why did you drink so much in the first place?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_29","text":"Ah.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_30","text":"Well...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_31","text":"Er...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_32","text":"Is it difficult to talk about?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_33","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_34","text":"It's the same reason as every other working stiff.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_35","text":"The endless workload and tight schedules.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_36","text":"The constantly changing demands from supervisors.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_37","text":"It wore me down, is all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_38","text":"So to soothe myself,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_39","text":"I thought I'd have a little drink to lift my spirits.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_40","text":"Just a little.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_41","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_41","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_42","text":"But that \"little drink\" ended up being several.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_43","text":"And then I ended up causing you trouble.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_44","text":"It's okay. I understand.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_45","text":"Thank you for being so understanding.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_46","text":"Next time, don't drink alone and reach out to me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_47","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_48","text":"You'd be willing to drink with me when I want to have a few?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_49","text":"Sure. It's lonely drinking alone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_50","text":"Oh wow.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_51","text":"I'd really like that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_52","text":"but are you sure you're okay with it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_53","text":"As you've seen,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_54","text":"I can't exactly handle my alcohol all that well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_55","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_55","text":"That's fine. I'll get drunk along with you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_56","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_57","text":"Well,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_58","text":"in that case,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_59","text":"I'll reach out to you","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_60","text":"the next time I feel like drinking.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_03_61","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_03_61","text":"Okay, I'll be waiting.","jump":null}],"chat":true}